<h2>What may be uploaded on this site</h2>

<p>On this site you are allowed to upload any and all images with some kind
of relation to the <a href='https://x.com/neppie_nep'>Vtuber Neppienep</a>.
Unrelated images will be removed.</p>

<p>Examples of <strong>welcome</strong> content:</p>
<ul>
    <li>Any artwork/content Neppienep has made herself</li>
    <li>Fanwork or commissioned pieces of art depicting Neppienep</li>
    <li>Screenshots from Neppienep's streams</li>
    <li>IRL photos depicting meet and greets, merchendise, or fanworks. You 
    may however only upload your own photos <strong>DO NOT</strong> upload
    photos taken by other people or depicting other people without their
    consent!!</li>
</ul>

<p>Examples of <strong>unwelcome</strong> content:</p>
<ul>
    <li>Content with no or unclear relation to Neppienep</li>
    <li>Content depicting Neppienep's friends without Neppienep (With one exception:
    it's welcome if that content serve as a set together with other content. For example:
    a page of manga or a continuation of another image. Please link the content)</li>
    <li>Content made by individuals who have been banned from Neppienep's community
    (not including clips/screenshots)</li>
    <li>IRL photos of Neppienep in a non-vtuber context, no matter if she
    has posted them herself or not</li>
    <li>Content containing doxx information of anyone</li>
    <li>Explicit content depiciting characters under the age of 18</li> 
    <li>AI generated images</li>
</ul>

<p>Despite the above, admins/Neppinep also reserves the right to remove any and all
content on this site for any reason at any time</p>

<h2>About the engine</h2>

<p>Szurubooru is an image board engine inspired by services such as Danbooru,
Gelbooru and Moebooru. Its name <a href='http://sjp.pwn.pl/sjp/;2527372'>has
its roots in Polish language and has onomatopeic meaning of scraping or
scrubbing</a>. It is pronounced as <em>shoorubooru</em>. Because this fork of
Szurubooru is dedicated to Neppienep, this version is called Nepbooru!</p>

<p class='section'><strong>Registration</strong></p>

